[86.988568, "o", "Sheets in workbook:\r\n  - Gold price\r\n  - Value\r\n  - Volume\r\n  - Total Reserves\r\n  - Answer\r\n\r\nAnswer Sheet Content:\r\n  Row 1: A=STEP 1: Gold Price Analysis, B=None\r\n"]
[86.98875, "o", "  Row 3: A=Latest Gold Price (USD/oz):, B==B71\r\n  Row 4: A=Latest 3-Month Volatility (%), B==D71\r\n  Row 5: A=3-Month Annualized Volatility (%), B==B4*SQRT(12)\r\n  Row 6: A=Latest 12-Month Volatility (%), B==E71\r\n  Row 10: A=STEP 2: Gold Reserves Value Analysis, B=None\r\n  Row 11: A=Country, B=Gold Reserves Value (Million USD)\r\n  Row 12: A==Value!A2, B==Value!B2\r\n  Row 13: A==Value!A3, B==Value!B3\r\n"]
[86.988788, "o", "  Row 14: A==Value!A4, B==Value!B4\r\n\r\nGold Price Sheet - Last few rows:\r\n  Row 69: Date=2025-08-31, Price=3000, LogRet==IFERROR(LN(B69/B68)*100,\"\"), Vol3M==IFERROR(STDEV(C67:C69),\"\"), Vol12M==IFERROR(STDEV(C58:C69),\"\")\r\n  Row 70: Date=2025-09-30, Price=3020.5, LogRet==IFERROR(LN(B70/B69)*100,\"\"), Vol3M==IFERROR(STDEV(C68:C70),\"\"), Vol12M==IFERROR(STDEV(C59:C70),\"\")\r\n  Row 71: Date=None, Price=None, LogRet=None, Vol3M=None, Vol12M=None\r\n\r\nWorkbook verification complete!\r\n"]
